# Phase A Week 7: Array/String Instructions Implementation

**주간 목표**: 배열/문자열 명령어 완전 구현
**기간**: 2026-03-11 ~ 2026-03-17
**상태**: 🚀 **시작**

---

## 📋 Week 7 구현 명령어 (8개)

### 메모리 레이아웃

```
Heap Memory Format:
┌─────────────────────────────┐
│ Metadata (u64)              │  = length or type
├─────────────────────────────┤
│ Element 0 (u64)             │
├─────────────────────────────┤
│ Element 1 (u64)             │
├─────────────────────────────┤
│ ...                         │
└─────────────────────────────┘

Address returned points to metadata, so:
- array_address = metadata address
- array_address + 1 = first element
- array_address + i+1 = i-th element
```

---

## 🔹 Array Instructions (0x40-0x43)

### 1️⃣ ARRALLOC (0x40) - 배열 할당

```rust
fn exec_arralloc(&mut self) -> Result<(), String> {
    // Pop array size
    let size = self.pop()?;

    // Get current heap pointer
    let array_addr = self.heap_ptr;

    // Check heap bounds (heap: 0x5000 - 0xFFFD, ~20K words)
    if array_addr + size + 1 >= 0xFFFE {
        return Err("ARRALLOC: Heap overflow".to_string());
    }

    // Write metadata (length)
    self.memory.write(array_addr, size)?;

    // Initialize array elements to 0
    for i in 0..size {
        self.memory.write(array_addr + 1 + i as usize, 0)?;
    }

    // Update heap pointer
    self.heap_ptr += (size + 1) as usize;

    // Push array address
    self.push(array_addr as u64)?;

    Ok(())
}
```

**스택 동작**:
```
Before: [size, ...]
After:  [array_address, ...]
```

**바이트코드 형식**:
```
[0x40]
```

---

### 2️⃣ ARRGET (0x41) - 배열 요소 읽기

```rust
fn exec_arrget(&mut self) -> Result<(), String> {
    // Pop index
    let index = self.pop()?;

    // Pop array address
    let array_addr = self.pop()? as usize;

    // Read array length
    let length = self.memory.read(array_addr)?;

    // Check bounds
    if index >= length {
        return Err(format!("ARRGET: Index out of bounds: {} >= {}", index, length));
    }

    // Read element
    let element = self.memory.read(array_addr + 1 + index as usize)?;

    // Push element
    self.push(element)?;

    Ok(())
}
```

**스택 동작**:
```
Before: [array_address, index, ...]
After:  [element, ...]
```

**바이트코드 형식**:
```
[0x41]
```

---

### 3️⃣ ARRSET (0x42) - 배열 요소 쓰기

```rust
fn exec_arrset(&mut self) -> Result<(), String> {
    // Pop value
    let value = self.pop()?;

    // Pop index
    let index = self.pop()?;

    // Pop array address
    let array_addr = self.pop()? as usize;

    // Read array length
    let length = self.memory.read(array_addr)?;

    // Check bounds
    if index >= length {
        return Err(format!("ARRSET: Index out of bounds: {} >= {}", index, length));
    }

    // Write element
    self.memory.write(array_addr + 1 + index as usize, value)?;

    Ok(())
}
```

**스택 동작**:
```
Before: [array_address, index, value, ...]
After:  [...]
```

**바이트코드 형식**:
```
[0x42]
```

---

### 4️⃣ ARRLEN (0x43) - 배열 길이

```rust
fn exec_arrlen(&mut self) -> Result<(), String> {
    // Pop array address
    let array_addr = self.pop()? as usize;

    // Read and validate address
    if array_addr >= 0x5000 {
        return Err("ARRLEN: Invalid array address".to_string());
    }

    // Read array length
    let length = self.memory.read(array_addr)?;

    // Push length
    self.push(length)?;

    Ok(())
}
```

**스택 동작**:
```
Before: [array_address, ...]
After:  [length, ...]
```

**바이트코드 형식**:
```
[0x43]
```

---

## 🔶 String Instructions (0x50-0x53)

### 5️⃣ STRALLOC (0x50) - 문자열 할당

```rust
fn exec_stralloc(&mut self) -> Result<(), String> {
    // Pop string length
    let length = self.pop()?;

    // Get current heap pointer
    let string_addr = self.heap_ptr;

    // Check heap bounds
    if string_addr + length + 1 >= 0xFFFE {
        return Err("STRALLOC: Heap overflow".to_string());
    }

    // Write metadata (length)
    self.memory.write(string_addr, length)?;

    // Initialize string to 0 (null bytes)
    for i in 0..length {
        self.memory.write(string_addr + 1 + i as usize, 0)?;
    }

    // Update heap pointer
    self.heap_ptr += (length + 1) as usize;

    // Push string address
    self.push(string_addr as u64)?;

    Ok(())
}
```

**스택 동작**:
```
Before: [length, ...]
After:  [string_address, ...]
```

**바이트코드 형식**:
```
[0x50]
```

---

### 6️⃣ STRGET (0x51) - 문자 읽기

```rust
fn exec_strget(&mut self) -> Result<(), String> {
    // Pop index
    let index = self.pop()?;

    // Pop string address
    let string_addr = self.pop()? as usize;

    // Read string length
    let length = self.memory.read(string_addr)?;

    // Check bounds
    if index >= length {
        return Err(format!("STRGET: Index out of bounds: {} >= {}", index, length));
    }

    // Read character
    let char_val = self.memory.read(string_addr + 1 + index as usize)?;

    // Push character
    self.push(char_val)?;

    Ok(())
}
```

**스택 동작**:
```
Before: [string_address, index, ...]
After:  [char_value, ...]
```

**바이트코드 형식**:
```
[0x51]
```

---

### 7️⃣ STRSET (0x52) - 문자 쓰기

```rust
fn exec_strset(&mut self) -> Result<(), String> {
    // Pop character value
    let char_val = self.pop()?;

    // Pop index
    let index = self.pop()?;

    // Pop string address
    let string_addr = self.pop()? as usize;

    // Read string length
    let length = self.memory.read(string_addr)?;

    // Check bounds
    if index >= length {
        return Err(format!("STRSET: Index out of bounds: {} >= {}", index, length));
    }

    // Write character (store in lower 8 bits)
    let masked_char = char_val & 0xFF;
    self.memory.write(string_addr + 1 + index as usize, masked_char)?;

    Ok(())
}
```

**스택 동작**:
```
Before: [string_address, index, char_value, ...]
After:  [...]
```

**바이트코드 형식**:
```
[0x52]
```

---

### 8️⃣ STRLEN (0x53) - 문자열 길이

```rust
fn exec_strlen(&mut self) -> Result<(), String> {
    // Pop string address
    let string_addr = self.pop()? as usize;

    // Read and validate address
    if string_addr >= 0x5000 {
        return Err("STRLEN: Invalid string address".to_string());
    }

    // Read string length
    let length = self.memory.read(string_addr)?;

    // Push length
    self.push(length)?;

    Ok(())
}
```

**스택 동작**:
```
Before: [string_address, ...]
After:  [length, ...]
```

**바이트코드 형식**:
```
[0x53]
```

