# Phase B Week 1: Garbage Collection Implementation

**주간 목표**: Mark-and-Sweep 가비지 컬렉션 구현
**기간**: 2026-03-03 ~ 2026-03-09
**상태**: 🚀 **시작**

---

## 📋 Phase B 개요

### 목표 (1-2주)
- Automatic memory management (GC)
- Heap fragmentation 감소
- Memory leak 방지
- Reference tracking system

### 아키텍처

```
┌─────────────────────────────┐
│ Phase A: Basic VM (✅ 완료)  │
├─────────────────────────────┤
│ Phase B: GC & Optimization  │
│  ├─ Week 1: Mark-Sweep GC  │ ← 이번주
│  ├─ Week 2: Heap Defrag    │
│  └─ Week 3: Integration    │
├─────────────────────────────┤
│ Phase C: FreeLang 통합      │
└─────────────────────────────┘
```

---

## 🧪 Week 1: Mark-and-Sweep GC 구현

### 핵심 개념

**Mark Phase**:
```
1. Root objects 확인 (stack, globals)
2. Reachable objects 모두 추적 (DFS)
3. Marked flag 설정
```

**Sweep Phase**:
```
1. Heap 전체 스캔
2. Unmarked objects 회수
3. Free list 업데이트
```

### 구현 계획

#### 1️⃣ HeapObject 구조 추가 (src/vm.rs)

```rust
#[derive(Debug, Clone)]
struct HeapObject {
    address: usize,          // Heap address
    size: usize,             // Size in words
    allocated: bool,         // Currently allocated
    marked: bool,            // Mark phase flag
    object_type: ObjectType, // Array or String
}

enum ObjectType {
    Array(usize),   // size
    String(usize),  // length
}
```

**목적**: 모든 heap allocation을 추적

#### 2️⃣ GarbageCollector 구조 추가 (src/gc.rs - 신규 파일)

```rust
pub struct GarbageCollector {
    heap_objects: Vec<HeapObject>,  // All allocations
    free_list: Vec<usize>,          // Free blocks
    gc_stats: GCStats,              // Statistics
}

pub struct GCStats {
    collections: u64,
    objects_freed: u64,
    total_freed_bytes: u64,
    collection_time_ms: f64,
}

impl GarbageCollector {
    pub fn new() -> Self { ... }

    pub fn mark_reachable(&mut self, stack: &[u64], globals: &[u64]) { ... }
    pub fn sweep(&mut self) { ... }
    pub fn collect(&mut self, stack: &[u64], globals: &[u64]) { ... }
    pub fn register_allocation(&mut self, address: usize, size: usize, obj_type: ObjectType) { ... }
    pub fn stats(&self) -> &GCStats { ... }
}
```

**목적**: GC 로직 캡슐화

#### 3️⃣ Mark Phase 구현

```rust
fn mark_reachable(&mut self, stack: &[u64], globals: &[u64]) {
    // Clear all marks
    for obj in &mut self.heap_objects {
        obj.marked = false;
    }

    let mut to_visit = Vec::new();

    // Add roots (stack + globals)
    for &value in stack {
        if self.is_heap_pointer(value) {
            to_visit.push(value as usize);
        }
    }
    for &value in globals {
        if self.is_heap_pointer(value) {
            to_visit.push(value as usize);
        }
    }

    // DFS traversal
    while let Some(addr) = to_visit.pop() {
        if let Some(obj) = self.find_object(addr) {
            if obj.marked {
                continue; // Already visited
            }
            obj.marked = true;

            // For arrays: scan elements for pointers
            if let ObjectType::Array(size) = obj.object_type {
                for i in 0..size {
